    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "0d92c7ec_23254322",
        "filename": "crypto/fips140-module.c",
        "patchSetId": 26
      },
      "lineNbr": 168,
      "author": {
        "id": 1843125
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-06-10T14:05:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This was not entirely correct: it is true that crypto_unregister_alg() will happily unregister the algorithm if it is moved to another list, but that doesn\u0027t mean the two list_del() / list_empty() invocations can safely overlap. So I will need to hold on to the lock here a bit longer, so that crypto_unregister_alg() observes the algo as being on one list or the other, but not in a limbo state.\n\nI prefer to keep the comment as-is, though (with the above added). The other case below needs some additional locking as well.",
      "parentUuid": "8a320247_e5b4efd0",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 166,
        "startChar": 34,
        "endLine": 168,
        "endChar": 28
      },
      "revId": "8f6855f089f98f225acb301f8b98d04de2f9af7e",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
